  "title": "Linear Self-Attention（线性自注意力）",
  "titleEn": "Linear Self-Attention",
  "titleZh": "线性自注意力",
  "description": "使用 CUDA 按 ELU+1 特征映射计算线性自注意力的归一化输出",
  "problemId": "linear-self-attention",
